{"sourceUrl":"https://slst.shanghaitech.edu.cn/2026/0730/c319a1125983/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:49.578854+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://slst.shanghaitech.edu.cn/2026/0730/c319a1125983/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span>上海科技大学生命学院自即日起启动招收</span><span>2027</span><span>年入学推免研究生的活动，欢迎全国各高校生命科学大类、药学、医学、化学、物理、计算机、数学及相关专业可以取得推荐免试资格的应届本科生报名。</span></p><p><strong><span>一、申请条件</span></strong></p><p><span>1</span><span>、道德品质良好，遵纪守法，诚实守信，学风端正，在校期间没有受过纪律处分，无学业学术不端记录；</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>、在本科阶段学习成绩优秀，专业排名一般需在前</span><span>30%</span><span>，且可以取得所在学校推荐免试资格；</span></p><p><span>3</span><span>、已通过校级英语水平测试或全国大学英语四级考试；</span></p><p><span>4</span><span>、对生命科学基础研究有浓厚兴趣，有志于生命科学前沿领域科研工作，并有较强的实验动手能力；</span></p><p><span>5</span><span>、身体健康状况符合规定的体检标准。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>二、接收程序</span></strong><span><br/> 1</span><span>、网上报名：</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>18</span><span>日（周五）</span><span>15</span><span>：</span><span>00</span><span>前在上海科技大学研究生招生报名系统</span><span>https://gadmission.shanghaitech.edu.cn/enroll_student/</span><span>完成申请，（建议使用</span><span>Chrome</span><span>内核的浏览器）。（</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>18</span><span>日</span><span>15</span><span>：</span><span>00</span><span>之后报名的视实际情况而定，请保持邮件和手机畅通）</span></p><p><span>登陆系统后，选择：【生命学院】</span><span>2027</span><span>招生年度推免生复试活动（九推）；进入【报名申请】，完成【基本信息填写】、【报名意愿填写】、【预览及提交报名信息】三个步骤即可。</span></p><p><strong><span>网报材料：</span></strong></p><p><span>A</span><span>（<strong><span>必须提供</span></strong>）</span><span>:</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）所在学校教务部门（或院系）出具并加盖公章的大学本科前三年所修课程成绩单（五年制的提供前四年课程成绩单）</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）年级</span><span>/</span><span>班级排名证明（院系或教务处盖章）</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）英语水平证明材料（四六级证书等）</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）个人简历（含</span><span>专业学习情况介绍，</span><span>中英文均可，无格式要求）</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>5</span><span>）有效身份证件正反面</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>6</span><span>）学生证（照片、学号页即可）</span></p><p><strong><span>B</span></strong><strong><span>（自愿提供）</span></strong><span>：推荐信（推荐人签名，可电子签名）和获奖证书复印件；</span></p><p><strong><span>C</span></strong><strong><span>（自愿提供）</span></strong><span>：已发表的论文、专利或其他原创性工作成果、其他有参考价值的证明材料。</span></p><p><strong><span>【网报材料命名规则】</span></strong></p><p><span>以上所有材料做成一份</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件，文件命名规则：如报名文件只有</span><span>A</span><span>文件，请命名为</span><span>“</span><span>姓名</span><span>+</span><span>高校名</span><span>+A”</span><span>；如报名文件同时含有</span><span>A</span><span>和</span><span>B</span><span>，则命名为</span><span>“</span><span>姓名</span><span>+</span><span>高校名</span><span>+AB”</span><span>；如含</span><span>A</span><span>和</span><span>C</span><span>，命名为</span><span>“</span><span>姓名</span><span>+</span><span>高校名</span><span>+AC”</span><span>；如含</span><span>A</span><span>，</span><span>B</span><span>和</span><span>C</span><span>，命名为</span><span>“</span><span>姓名</span><span>+</span><span>高校名</span><span>+ABC”</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>将按规则命名后的网报材料，保存为一份</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件（示例：张三</span><span>+XX</span><span>大学</span><span>+ABC</span><span>），整个文件不超过</span><span>10M</span><span>，上传至报名系统【网报材料】中。</span></p><p><strong><span>填报说明</span></strong><span>：登录后，可以在首页发现【生命学院】</span><strong><span>2027</span></strong><strong><span>招生年度推免生复试活动（九推）</span></strong><span>，在操作栏点击【报名申请】，在跳出的页面中完成：</span></p><p><span>------</span><span>❶</span><span>基本信息填写（如实填写各项内容，最后一栏选择附件即对应上述文件；完成后保存一下）</span></p><p><span>------</span><span>❷</span><span>报名意愿填写（根据自己了解的意向进行填写即可，该内容与复试录取无关；完成后保存一下）</span></p><p><span>------</span><span>❸</span><span>预览及提交报名信息（预览检查无误后，点击页尾提交即可）。</span></p><p><span>完成信息填报，</span><strong><span>网报系统使用说明和注意事项参见下方</span></strong><strong><span>PDF</span></strong><strong><span>附件</span></strong><span>。</span><span>提交前请仔细检查，提交后则无法修改。</span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://slst.shanghaitech.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif\"/><a href=\"https://slst.shanghaitech.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/37/3a/2a82c361464a86eee0ec8cc2f75e/6ca5d707-40f2-4523-914a-00ade5393a98.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件.上科大生命学院研究生招生报名系统操作指南（九推）-260728.pdf</a></span></p><p><span><span> </span></span></p><p><span>2</span><span>、复试</span></p><p><span>1</span><span>）预计</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>24</span><span>日之后邮件通知获得复试资格的同学以及分批复试时间；</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>）复试形式：综合素质上机测试、线下面试；</span></p><p><span>3</span><span>）复试合格者，发放拟接收函；</span></p><p><span><span> </span></span></p><p><span>3</span><span>、教育部网上报名：复试合格并且取得学校外推免试资格的同学，请于</span><span>9</span><span>月下旬开始按教育部网上报名要求进行报名；</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>三、注意事项</span></strong></p><p><span>1</span><span>、申请人必须保证全部申请材料的真实性和准确性。如果申请人提交的信息不真实或不准确，将取消申请人免试资格。全部申请材料一经收到，概不退还。</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>、获得我院推免生接收资格，且完成教育部网上推免填报的同学，不得再联系出国、就业及其他招生单位。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>四、其他</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>本通知如有与国家新出台的招生政策或上海市相关文件不符的事项，以上级单位新政策或文件要求为准。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>五、联系方式</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>QQ</span><span>群：</span><span>873867193</span><span>（群名：【九推】上科大生命学院</span><span>2027</span><span>推免生活动）<span>，加群二维码详见文末附件</span></span></p><p><span>联系人：浦老师</span></p><p><span>电话：</span><span>021-20685438</span></p><p><span>邮箱：</span><span><a href=\"mailto:grad.admission.slst@shanghaitech.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>grad.admission.slst@shanghaitech.edu.cn</span></a></span></p><p><span>地址：上海市浦东新区华夏中路</span><span>393</span><span>号生命学院</span><span>L</span><span>楼</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://slst.shanghaitech.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif\"/><a href=\"https://slst.shanghaitech.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/37/3a/2a82c361464a86eee0ec8cc2f75e/f09b526b-597e-47f6-a1d5-1bbd2bad97db.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">九推QQ群二维码.pdf</a></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"b5fc8b74a6f6d9d2d82f48e37517ad570b4021c985e278388200f38ff7c2a972","textLength":1689,"sourceSha256":"677fb9f2bf16c4d3af782a2050b97abc7b9c1242f8f8babecf602a4e7a65a6b2","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-793414933c50299e0fc3","title":"2026年上海科技大学生命科学与技术学院接收2027年入学推免生（含直博）通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:49.578854+00:00"}
